{"page":134,"verses":[{"verse_key":"6:53","surah":6,"ayah":53,"ar_uthmani":"وَكَذَٰلِكَ فَتَنَّا بَعْضَهُم بِبَعْضٍ لِّيَقُولُوٓا۟ أَهَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ مَنَّ ٱللَّهُ عَلَيْهِم مِّنۢ بَيْنِنَآ ۗ أَلَيْسَ ٱللَّهُ بِأَعْلَمَ بِٱلشَّـٰكِرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We have made some of them a test for others, to make the disbelievers say, ‘Is it these men that God has favoured among us?’ Does God not know best who are the grateful ones?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَكَذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"And thus","transliteration":"wakadhālika","verse_key":"6:53"},{"pos":2,"ar":"فَتَنَّا","en_gloss":"We try","transliteration":"fatannā","verse_key":"6:53"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بَعْضَهُم","en_gloss":"some of them","transliteration":"baʿḍahum","verse_key":"6:53"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بِبَعْضٍۢ","en_gloss":"with others","transliteration":"bibaʿḍin","verse_key":"6:53"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لِّيَقُولُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"that they say","transliteration":"liyaqūlū","verse_key":"6:53"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَهَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ","en_gloss":"Are these","transliteration":"ahāulāi","verse_key":"6:53"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مَنَّ","en_gloss":"(whom has been) favored","transliteration":"manna","verse_key":"6:53"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"(by) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"6:53"},{"pos":9,"ar":"عَلَيْهِم","en_gloss":"[upon them]","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","verse_key":"6:53"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِّنۢ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"6:53"},{"pos":11,"ar":"بَيْنِنَآ ۗ","en_gloss":"among us","transliteration":"bayninā","verse_key":"6:53"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَلَيْسَ","en_gloss":"is not","transliteration":"alaysa","verse_key":"6:53"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"6:53"},{"pos":14,"ar":"بِأَعْلَمَ","en_gloss":"most knowing","transliteration":"bi-aʿlama","verse_key":"6:53"},{"pos":15,"ar":"بِٱلشَّـٰكِرِينَ","en_gloss":"of those who are grateful","transliteration":"bil-shākirīna","verse_key":"6:53"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٥٣","en_gloss":"(53)","trans