,"verse_key":"6:58"},{"pos":4,"ar":"عِندِى","en_gloss":"(were) with me","transliteration":"ʿindī","verse_key":"6:58"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"6:58"},{"pos":6,"ar":"تَسْتَعْجِلُونَ","en_gloss":"you seek to hasten","transliteration":"tastaʿjilūna","verse_key":"6:58"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِهِۦ","en_gloss":"of it","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"6:58"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لَقُضِىَ","en_gloss":"surely would have been decided","transliteration":"laquḍiya","verse_key":"6:58"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْأَمْرُ","en_gloss":"the matter","transliteration":"l-amru","verse_key":"6:58"},{"pos":10,"ar":"بَيْنِى","en_gloss":"between me","transliteration":"baynī","verse_key":"6:58"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَبَيْنَكُمْ ۗ","en_gloss":"and between you","transliteration":"wabaynakum","verse_key":"6:58"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"6:58"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أَعْلَمُ","en_gloss":"(is) most knowing","transliteration":"aʿlamu","verse_key":"6:58"},{"pos":14,"ar":"بِٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","en_gloss":"of the wrongdoers","transliteration":"bil-ẓālimīna","verse_key":"6:58"},{"pos":15,"ar":"٥٨","en_gloss":"(58)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"6:58"}]},{"verse_key":"6:59","surah":6,"ayah":59,"ar_uthmani":"۞ وَعِندَهُۥ مَفَاتِحُ ٱلْغَيْبِ لَا يَعْلَمُهَآ إِلَّا هُوَ ۚ وَيَعْلَمُ مَا فِى ٱلْبَرِّ وَٱلْبَحْرِ ۚ وَمَا تَسْقُطُ مِن وَرَقَةٍ إِلَّا يَعْلَمُهَا وَلَا حَبَّةٍ فِى ظُلُمَـٰتِ ٱلْأَرْضِ وَلَا رَطْبٍ وَلَا يَابِسٍ إِلَّا فِى كِتَـٰبٍ مُّبِينٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"He has the keys to the unseen: no one knows them but Him. He knows all that is in the land and sea. No leaf falls without His knowledge, nor is there a single grain in the darkness of the earth, or anything, fresh or withered, that is not written in a clear Record.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ وَعِندَهُۥ","en_gloss":"And with Him","transliteration":"waʿindahu","verse_key":"6:59"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مَفَاتِحُ","en_gloss":"(are the) keys","transl